{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolicInclusion","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolicInclusion","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolicCoset","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeMonodromyJordan"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.iotaPar_monodromyN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.iotaPar_monodromyN","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicInclusion.lean#L128-L143","doc":"**The NILPOTENT square at every rank** (over `ℂ`, at the monodromy\npoint `q = i`): the inclusion intertwines the Jordan nilpotents,\n`ι ∘ N_J = N ∘ ι` — the abstract form of the merged\n`iota34_monodromyN`, with no faithfulness residue. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.iotaPar_mulStep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.iotaPar_mulStep","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicInclusion.lean#L109-L126","doc":"**The ACTION square at every rank**: the inclusion intertwines the\ngenerator step actions, for every `l ∈ J`, over any commutative ring —\nthe abstract form of the merged `iota34_mulσ₀` / `iota34_mulσ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.iotaPar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.iotaPar","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicInclusion.lean#L101-L105","doc":"**The tower inclusion**: extension by zero along the coset\ndecomposition, supported on the trivial coset. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.descentParabolic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.descentParabolic","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicInclusion.lean#L87-L99","doc":"The induced descent structure of `l ∈ J` on the parabolic subtype:\nthe subgroup is closed under the step and inherits the length data. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.mul_simple_mem_parabolic_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.mul_simple_mem_parabolic_iff","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicInclusion.lean#L78-L85","doc":"Membership in the parabolic is invariant under the generator step. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.mul_simple_mem_parabolic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.mul_simple_mem_parabolic","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicInclusion.lean#L73-L76","doc":"Right multiplication by a generator of `J` preserves the parabolic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.descentRight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.descentRight","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterParabolicInclusion.lean#L61-L69","doc":"The right-multiplication descent structure of a single generator on\nthe full group — the abstract form of the transversals' step maps. ","signatureChunk":0}]}